message: "If you use this code or data, please cite the paper (manuscript under review) and this repository."
title: "El Niño, heat extremes, drought and mortality in India, 2001–2024: data and code"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-22
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/hssling/elnino-heat-india"
url: "https://github.com/hssling/elnino-heat-india"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Siddalingaiah"
    given-names: "H S"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4771-8285"
    affiliation: "Department of Community Medicine, Shridevi Institute of Medical Sciences and Research Hospital, Tumakuru, Karnataka, India"
